# The turn change under Motion: Full (the harness forces Reduce motion, the Display tab switches it back): after Submit the pill's hint
# segment cross-fades to "Black to move" for 1.2 s instead of a banner dropping over the turn ruler. Frames are captured 3, 9, 24, 48 and
# 90 frames after the click. Layout (1400x800): Settings (150,490), Display tab (880,172), the Motion button the second Display option
# (200,308); Versus (150,250), Standard (905,224), Play (808,712), Submit (841,90).
wait 20
click 150 490        # Settings
wait 30
click 880 172        # Display tab
wait 20
click 200 308        # Motion: Reduced -> Full
wait 20
click 125 25         # Back
wait 30
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 905 224        # Standard
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 150
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 30
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 40
click 841 90         # Submit
move 880 740         # (the pointer leaves, so no tooltip covers the ruler)
wait 3
capture layout-banner-f03
wait 6
capture layout-banner-f09
wait 15
capture layout-banner-f24
wait 24
capture layout-banner-f48
wait 42
capture layout-banner-f90
